ADDITIONAL NOTICE FOR THE WILLY LINUX BUILD TREE

This repository contains the live-build configuration (hooks, package lists,
includes.chroot files, willy-* helper tools, the installer and the
documentation) used to build the Willy Linux live ISO. It is NOT a copy of
Debian and grants no rights over Debian's own packages.

The Debian packages included in a built ISO remain under their own upstream
licenses, listed in /usr/share/doc/*/copyright of the installed system.

The artwork (logo and wallpapers) is distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

A full verbatim copy of GPLv3 is available at:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
